{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1073910/extras/c30ea7283a94b5f3d334826f4f9f62e0.avif?t=1761829965\" width=616 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rediscover what was lost and nurture your reborn civilisation in Before We Leave, a city building game set in a cozy corner of the universe. Grow, gather and manage resources to help your settlements thrive, and share goods between the hexagonal lands and planets around you. Relax and expand the fabric of your growing societies and create a solar system of happy planets at your own pace. Not everything will go your way, though - use your wits and research solutions to overcome the challenges that your ancestors once faced.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build</strong> settlements for the newly emerged Peeps</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Discover</strong> and research the ancient technologies around you</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Manage</strong> resources, pollution and happiness to avoid the mistakes of your ancestors</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Trade</strong> between your settlements by sea and by space</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore</strong> six unique biomes on islands of all shapes and sizes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Protect</strong> the Peeps from ancient beings that guard the galaxy</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >THE STORY</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your Peeps have spent generations underground. They\u2019ve missed the caress of sun on skin, the squelch of soil between toes, the tickle of flies on noses. They emerge, full of wonder, but with no idea how to grow anything - except potatoes. Start rebuilding their lost civilisation by providing shelter, uncovering ancient technology, and expanding this reborn society to other continents and planets. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1073910/extras/dd7b38ab342b6f00c344b2f79b33eddb.avif?t=1761829965\" width=616 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But the universe is not safe. Ancient, ancestral guardians demand attention and challenge your settlements - it\u2019s up to you to circumvent these creatures that hamper progress and disturb your newfound peace. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1073910/extras/9feb61551db45fa06b3b875f5ae7ff1e.avif?t=1761829965\" width=616 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are no weapons, no battles with neighbours for control of resources - just you, and a solar system full of opportunities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1073910/extras/4e91dcbffaa24c03b63659acb008871c.avif?t=1761829965\" width=616 height=200 /></span></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"icon":"9dbdc719785b2fd5e4c5d083ce2261d92af43f49.jpg","localized_name":"Seaworthy","name":"Seaworthy","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1073910/9dbdc719785b2fd5e4c5d083ce2261d92af43f49.jpg"},{"icon":"febbe027bafa9603700819312e84ee96714441f8.jpg","localized_name":"The Stars Beckon","name":"The Stars Beckon","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1073910/febbe027bafa9603700819312e84ee96714441f8.jpg"},{"icon":"0bd4419fbc6fcd4d82772e76d05b2dc55df3b5de.jpg","localized_name":"A New Home","name":"A New Home","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1073910/0bd4419fbc6fcd4d82772e76d05b2dc55df3b5de.jpg"},{"icon":"f04c09f59c1fef3060fb030e7339f44396e2f997.jpg","localized_name":"It's Bright Out There","name":"It's Bright Out There","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1073910/f04c09f59c1fef3060fb030e7339f44396e2f997.jpg"},{"icon":"ea4ce4379aeeceb52781034e442850c658240b80.jpg","localized_name":"The Dark Reaches","name":"The Dark Reaches","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1073910/ea4ce4379aeeceb52781034e442850c658240b80.jpg"},{"icon":"6d7a5422f9e1436ce1ddca3061cff0fc79b86a12.jpg","localized_name":"What was That?","name":"What was That?","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1073910/6d7a5422f9e1436ce1ddca3061cff0fc79b86a12.jpg"},{"icon":"d0fbe40d71e6f8f3304cced7032145878575504d.jpg","localized_name":"Feed The Beast","name":"Feed The Beast","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1073910/d0fbe40d71e6f8f3304cced7032145878575504d.jpg"},{"icon":"f05f62283eb381522b7370032ea7692d8222c3da.jpg","localized_name":"A Whole New World","name":"A Whole New World","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1073910/f05f62283eb381522b7370032ea7692d8222c3da.jpg"},{"icon":"e5fa3c25ce099791ebe1793b2f681ee4c6da5922.jpg","localized_name":"Heart of the Labyrinth","name":"Heart of the Labyrinth","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1073910/e5fa3c25ce099791ebe1793b2f681ee4c6da5922.jpg"},{"icon":"6765daf5d033be1b54cbc1048e543f3a07c1e4b1.jpg","localized_name":"Debug Mode","name":"Debug Mode","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1073910/6765daf5d033be1b54cbc1048e543f3a07c1e4