s=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Trade</strong> between your settlements by sea and by space</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore</strong> six unique biomes on islands of all shapes and sizes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Protect</strong> the Peeps from ancient beings that guard the galaxy</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >THE STORY</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your Peeps have spent generations underground. They\u2019ve missed the caress of sun on skin, the squelch of soil between toes, the tickle of flies on noses. They emerge, full of wonder, but with no idea how to grow anything - except potatoes. Start rebuilding their lost civilisation by providing shelter, uncovering ancient technology, and expanding this reborn society to other continents and planets. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1073910/extras/dd7b38ab342b6f00c344b2f79b33eddb.avif?t=1761829965\" width=616 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But the universe is not safe. Ancient, ancestral guardians demand attention and challenge your settlements - it\u2019s up to you to circumvent these creatures that hamper progress and disturb your newfound peace. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1073910/extras/9feb61551db45fa06b3b875f5ae7ff1e.avif?t=1761829965\" width=616 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are no weapons, no battles with neighbours for control of resources - just you, and a solar system full of opportunities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1073910/extras/4e91dcbffaa24c03b63659acb008871c.avif?t=1761829965\" width=616 height=200 /></span></p>","developers":["Balancing Monkey Games"],"dlc":[1568770],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1073910/header.jpg?t=1761829965","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"Before We Leave \u00a9 2019 @ \u2122 Balancing Monkey Games Ltd","linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> OSX 10.14.2 Mojave (64-bit)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel\u00ae Core\u2122 i5 3.0GHz, 21.5<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> 2 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2 GB available space</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"metacritic":{"score":72,"url":"https://www.metacritic.com/game/pc/before-we-leave?ftag=MCD-06-10aaa1f"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1073910/369404/2b6686a001aad50a6429bdf94896ea52da061783/1750612692/dash_av1.mpd?t=1620921889","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1073910/369404/2b6686a001aad50a6429bdf94896ea52da061783/1750612692/dash_h264.mpd?t=1620921889","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1073910/369404/2b6686a001aad50a6429bdf94896ea52da061783/1750612692/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1620921889","id":256834556,"name":"Before We Leave: Accolades Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/256