d operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 (64 bit only)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-4300U or AMD Phenom II X4 975<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 550 Ti or AMD Radeon HD 4890<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2 GB available space</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 (64 bit only)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-9400 or AMD Ryzen 5 3400G<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA Geforce GTX 970 or AMD Radeon RX 590<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2 GB available space</li></ul>"},"platforms":{"linux":false,"mac":true,"windows":true},"price_overview":{"currency":"USD","discount_percent":0,"final":1999,"final_formatted":"$19.99 USD","initial":1999,"initial_formatted":""},"publishers":["Team17"],"ratings":{"dejus":{"rating":"l"},"igrs":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"Kekerasan","rating":"13","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"13","use_age_gate":"0"},"kgrb":{"rating":"all"},"steam_germany":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"Fantasy-Gewalt","rating":"6","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"6","use_age_gate":"0"}},"recommendations":{"total":1255},"release_date":{"coming_soon":false,"date":"13 May, 2021"},"required_age":0,"reviews":"\u201cThe \u201cnon-violence\u201d thing is what separates Before We Leave from other games in the 4X strategy genre. There\u2019s no conquering or battles, unless you count human impact on the natural world \u2014 which, certainly, should be counted.\u201d<br>Polygon<br><br>\u201cCute little city-builder with big ambitions and even bigger cosmic cetaceans.\u201d<br>71/100 \u2013 PC Gamer<br><br>\u201ca polished city builder which takes known tenets of the genre to forge its own direction.\u201d<br>8.6/10 \u2013 The Games Machine<br>","screenshots":[{"id":0,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1073910/ss_6de57193d5f037e8e1f11ef3566d1806a6af2122.1920x1080.jpg?t=1761829965","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1073910/ss_6de57193d5f037e8e1f11ef3566d1806a6af2122.600x338.jpg?t=1761829965"},{"id":1,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1073910/ss_48cf3bc5d9bc9788d061948857b740334a773653.1920x1080.jpg?t=1761829965","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1073910/ss_48cf3bc5d9bc9788d061948857b740334a773653.600x338.jpg?t=1761829965"},{"id":2,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1073910/ss_1cbc6e860d05e57e7c4883e81a8fefa0d808870d.1920x1080.jpg?t=1761829965","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1073910/ss_1cbc6e860d05e57e7c4883e81a8fefa0d808870d.600x338.jpg?t=1761829965"},{"id":3,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1073910/ss_0df81f4ec14860beb2eff4106767895799e9fc05.1920x1080.jpg?t=1761829965","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1073910/ss_0df81f4ec14860beb2eff4106767895799e9fc05.600x338.jpg?t=1761829965"},{"id":4,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1073910/ss_5112aa86cdd498c254dac4db640809d780d75723.1920x1080.jpg?t=1761829965","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1073910/ss_5112aa86cdd498c254dac4db640809d780d75723.600x338.jpg?t=1761829965"},{"id":5,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1073910/ss_3ced35335ea7f55b5b575fe2adbed7e71baf2511.1920x1080.jpg?t=1761829965","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai